<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Dec unemployment rate rises to 2.3 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Dec unemployment rate rises to 2.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's seasonally-adjusted unemployment rate rose to 2.3 percent in December from 1.9 percent a year earlier, provisional figures from the National Statistical Office showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>					  Dec 96  Nov 96    Dec 95</p>
<p>    Unemployment (pct)		 2.3     2.2	 1.9</p>
<p>					    (2.3)   (2.0)     (1.8)</p>
<p>NOTE: bracketed figures exclude seasonal factors.</p>
<p>The economically active population rose to 61.5 percent of the total in December from 60.8 percent a year earlier.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
